{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","settings":{"padding_top":"no-indent","padding_bottom":"no-indent"}},"69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-0":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"1. Placing An Order","text":"<p>Once your order is placed, you will receive an order confirmation.<\/p><p>Unfortunately, once an order has been placed, we are unable to make any changes to the order or shipping information so please ensure all details are correct prior to purchasing.<\/p><p>If you need assistance with anything from placing an order or a question about a product, please contact us via live chat or email us at <a href=\"mailto:minimalista@hello.com\" title=\"mailto:minimalista@hello.com\">minimalista@hello.com<\/a>.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}},"template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"2. Order Processing","text":"<p>Orders placed before 12:00 PM EST will be processed and dispatched within 2-3 business days. Orders placed after 12:00 PM EST will begin the processing period of the next business day.<\/p><p>You will receive an email confirmation once the order has been shipped. Please note, processing times do not include weekends or U.S. federal holidays.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}},"template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"3. Tracking An Order","text":"<p>Once your order has shipped, you will receive an email confirmation with a tracking number.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}},"34b8f46a-59fd-4ba9-b4e9-3923bf63510c":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"4. Promotions & Discounts","text":"<p>Welcome first customer promotion can be used on one (1) purchase only. Discount codes are only applicable to full price items and can not be applied to styles purchased on sale.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}},"ad9b1f1f-220e-4e96-9817-ebd058f3d9ee":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"5. Taxes & Duties","text":"<p>Tax will be calculated based on the total value of merchandise, applied as governed by state sales tax regulations based on the ship to state, and will be displayed once your shipping address is entered.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}},"e2d34984-0bba-427c-b59d-a29c29a1b0ac":{"type":"column","settings":{"icon":"none","heading":"6. Missing \/ Stolen Orders","text":"<p>If tracking information reflects successful delivery but you have not received it, please email <a href=\"mailto:minimalista@hello.com\" title=\"mailto:minimalista@hello.com\">minimalista@hello.com<\/a>. Please note, we do not take responsibility for lost or missing packages that show delivery confirmation.<\/p>","show_button":false,"button_label":"Label","button_link":"","button_style":"primary","full_link":false,"additional_text_1":"","additional_text_2":""}}},"block_order":["template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-0","template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-1","template--19863253778734__69fb36fb-8f02-43df-95b1-eed79288e7d3-1688548121d4194052-2","34b8f46a-59fd-4ba9-b4e9-3923bf63510c","ad9b1f1f-220e-4e96-9817-ebd0